{"success":true,"code":"000","message":null,"data":{"totalAmount":2,"totalPageCount":1,"pageNum":0,"itemCount":2,"content":[{"pageNum":0,"pageSize":0,"id":"6af3e8e6d6006945d280ab8b","chatId":"e323db3b71544a50848428ee6d2a2e55","sessionId":null,"userId":69295,"orgId":3721,"botId":1030,"isGreeting":false,"role":"role","content":"```json\n{\n  \"answer_q1\": \"A\",\n  \"answer_q2\": \"A\"\n}\n```","options":null,"imageContent":null,"audioContent":null,"videoContent":null,"reminderContext":null,"videoCoverUrl":null,"chips":null,"customMessage":null,"media":null,"mediaTime":null,"interceptContent":null,"contents":[{"content":"```json\n{\n  \"answer_q1\": \"A\",\n  \"answer_q2\": \"A\"\n}\n```","options":null,"isShow":true,"label":"","evaluate":"","takingTime":823,"promptTokens":1482,"completionTokens":24,"responseSource":"agent:llm","censorData":{"labels":null,"words":null},"createTime":"2026-11-11 12:02:46"}],"imgs":null,"regenerations":0,"seqNum":3,"responseSource":"agent:llm","isSuicide":false,"isSuicideConf":0.009704339139936112,"emotions":[],"relationId":"6af3e8e6d6006945d280ab8a","courseProgressId":0,"tsGen":1794369766467,"createTime":"2026-11-11 12:02:46","delFlag":0,"emotionTendency":null,"sourceProductType":null,"sourceProductId":null,"consultantBotId":null,"consultantUserId":null},{"pageNum":0,"pageSize":0,"id":"6af3e8e6d6006945d280ab8a","chatId":"e323db3b71544a50848428ee6d2a2e55","sessionId":null,"userId":69295,"orgId":3721,"botId":1030,"isGreeting":false,"role":"user","content":"# 说明\n在这个任务中，你会面临一个场景、一个问题和多个选项。\n仔细分析场景，并从相关人员的角度进行思考。\n然后，选择最能反映他们的观点或情绪反应的选项。\n\n# 输出\n\n只提供一个正确的答案。 不要提供任何额外的信息或解释。 回复应采用以下JSON格式：\n\n```json\n    {\n    \"answer_q1\": \"<用相应的字母进行回答问题1>\",\n\"answer_q2\": \"<用相应的字母进行回答问题2>\"\n\n    }\n``` \n    \n\n## 场景\n茵迪和简为他们最好的朋友布莱尔三天后的生日准备了一个惊喜。生日前一天，三个人一起在布莱尔的房间玩耍，茵迪不小心说起了那个惊喜。在她说的更多前，简假装咳嗽了一声并瞪了茵迪一眼。\n\n## 问题 1\n在这种情况下，茵迪最终会感受到什么情绪？\n\n## 问题 1 的选项\nA) 尴尬\nB) 气恼\nC) 没意识的\nD) 嫉妒\nE) 惊喜\nF) 期待\n\n## 问题 2\n茵迪为什么会在这种情况下感受到这些情绪？\n\n## 问题 2 的选项\nA) 她差点毁了她和简为布莱尔准备的生日惊喜\nB) 茵迪因为忘记了布莱尔的生日而感到内疚\nC) 她因为在布莱尔的房间里绊到玩具而感到尴尬\nD) 她无缘无故地从简那里收到了愤怒的目光。","options":null,"imageContent":null,"audioContent":null,"videoContent":null,"reminderContext":null,"videoCoverUrl":null,"chips":null,"customMessage":null,"media":null,"mediaTime":null,"interceptContent":null,"contents":[],"imgs":null,"regenerations":0,"seqNum":2,"responseSource":"agent:llm","isSuicide":false,"isSuicideConf":0.009704339139936112,"emotions":[],"relationId":"6af3e8e6d6006945d280ab8b","courseProgressId":0,"tsGen":1794369766464,"createTime":"2026-11-11 12:02:46","delFlag":0,"emotionTendency":null,"sourceProductType":null,"sourceProductId":null,"consultantBotId":null,"consultantUserId":null}],"first":true,"last":true},"nonce":"dae12f6947f84ed7bd3e8c7915732acb"}